  "releaseNotes": "'## [13.3.2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.3.1...v13.3.2) (2026-10-06)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **operator:** key timed entity queue by uid to keep delete/recreate events apart ([#1267](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1267)) ([283c508](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/283c5080585c19e1fa43511fb47bdd338b31c1a8)), closes [#1266](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1266) [#801](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/801) [#800](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/800)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update dependency @semantic-release/github to v12.0.10 ([#1257](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1257)) ([082da86](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/082da863d0bd2b5b2c5eac6265d2eb5c243678a9))\n* **core:** update aspire monorepo ([#1265](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1265)) ([64ed1c9](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/64ed1c9d092df396eb964d7436b6342f94ca6747))\n* **core:** update dependency messagepack to 3.1.11 ([#1268](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1268)) ([54e0a45](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/54e0a45adf5dc06974b499446544fb92a1253f3c))\n* **core:** update dependency roslynator.analyzers to 5.0.1 ([#1269](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1269)) ([58ce54c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/58ce54cec99e8e849f6afa3bf5570df15f5b8c76))\n'",
